Searching lx164nt.rom Error

Call the file lx164nt.rom -- The description within the howto is wrong. 
I had the same trouble while updating to AlphaBIOS 5.70.

Make shure that the pins 2 + 3 of Jumper J28 on the parentboard are 
jumpered together -- wich is the default. Otherwise, the flash ROM is

write protected.

