Minor correction: ev56 does have the BWX extension, that's
what makes it different from ev5 (besides a structure shrink,
IIRC). So the table of instruction set extensions inside the
21164 family should read:

         BWX    MVI
ev5       -      -
ev56      X      -
pca56     X      X

